# SEO & Metadata Rules

Every important page must have:
- title + description
- Open Graph (title, description, images)
- Twitter card (summary_large_image)
- icons (favicon + apple-touch-icon)

Use Next.js Metadata API. Never leave default metadata.

Add missing metadata to existing layouts. Do not replace working pages to do it.
